<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Forgive me, Lord I’m open to You.</l><l>Fill me more and more each day.</l><l>Build me with the saints in love</l><l>And keep us running toward the prize.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord keep me growing and functioning.</l><l>Don’t ever let me out of Your sight.</l><l>Grant me a spirit of boldness.</l><l>Open my mouth, Lord, to prophesy.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
